{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0ae9aa9dc5a833d8ca8","chatId":"83a944d02b194908abaf63d1ca9181a8","sessionId":null,"userId":98422,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":2065,"promptTokens":1506,"completionTokens":164,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:10"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007574718015659908,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0ae9aa9dc5a833d8ca7","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482350920,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:10","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a0ae9aa9dc5a833d8ca7","chatId":"83a944d02b194908abaf63d1ca9181a8","sessionId":null,"userId":98422,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n新学期，大学为新生组织了一场10英里的马拉松比赛。艾萨克是跑步新手，但他想参加这次马拉松并能完成它，无论要花多长时间。因此，他在活动前准备了很长时间。 活动当天，刚到终点的艾萨克双手叉腰，面部紧皱。随后，他的脸浮现出了微笑。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，艾萨克最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 悲观\nB) 娱乐\nC) 开心\nD) 气恼\nE) 自豪\nF) 生气\n\n## 问题 2\n艾萨克为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 他完成了他努力训练准备的马拉松比赛\nB) 他并没有赢得10英里的马拉松\nC) 艾萨克是第一个越过终点线的人\nD) 他不想感到疲惫","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007574718015659908,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0ae9aa9dc5a833d8ca8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482350917,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:10","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"a4378a175535405fa4567faeffb364df"}